{"version":1,"content":"<p>路透社和法新社周五（30日）分別引述消息人士報道，巴西周四召見阿根廷駐當地臨時代辦科爾特斯（María Emilia Cortés），要求對方就巴西前總統博索納羅之子、本月總統大選參選人弗拉維奧（Flávio Bolsonaro）途經阿根廷潛逃往美國一事作出解釋。</p><p>阿根廷官方否認曾接獲任何要求解釋的通知。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:12.669484+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":153,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T06:58:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:42.059881+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:42.059881+00:00","content_hash":"a0744f968a067a89ac9a486d470d121826212be45c631b2ea8148569443bcba0","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}